# W6-05-01 / W6-05-02 / W6-05-10 on a real campaign map (ALL04, Chicago):
# - the player's house colour is its map Color=DarkBlue through rules
#   [Colors] (kColorSchemeBase 8 + DarkBlue's index 10 = 18), not list gold;
# - every map cell's tile resolves (warub*.urb from urban.mix: no black
#   holes), and no cell needs the clear-ground fallback.
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL04U.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
wait 3
assert house_color(0) == 18                              @W6-05-01
cheat reveal
wait 2
shot all04_revealed
assert tile_misses == 0                                  @W6-05-02
assert tile_fallbacks == 0                               @W6-05-10
end
